</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Praying to express the Lord,</l><l>We must utter His intent,</l><l>Quieting our human thoughts</l><l>That with His our mind be blent.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Praying to express the Lord,</l><l>Ever looking unto Him</l><l>As a mirror to reflect</l><l>All His glory from within.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Praying to express the Lord,</l><l>Letting Him beseech in us;</l><l>Christ indwelling prays within</l><l>To the Christ in heaven thus.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Praying to express the Lord,</l><l>Learning not to pray by self,</l><l>Praying wholly with the Lord,</l><l>Praying only by Himself.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
